1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:02,339
Point your phone at a ceiling light.

2
00:00:02,339 --> 00:00:03,677
Switch to slow motion.

3
00:00:04,177 --> 00:00:05,334
Now look closely.

4
00:00:05,834 --> 00:00:10,399
Some lights are pulsing, 100 or 120 times a second.

5
00:00:10,949 --> 00:00:13,566
That is twice the rate of the power in your wall.

6
00:00:13,866 --> 00:00:16,266
Your eyes blur it into a steady glow.

7
00:00:16,266 --> 00:00:19,120
The camera's quick snapshots catch the dips.

8
00:00:19,620 --> 00:00:21,511
Good LEDs barely flicker.

9
00:00:21,511 --> 00:00:23,780
Cheap or dimmed ones often do.

10
00:00:23,780 --> 00:00:24,915
Go check yours.
